# The SDD directory is the durable record of how this project was built: each
# phase's ledger (what every task did, what its reviewers found, every ruling
# taken on the user's behalf), the per-task briefs, the implementer reports,
# the review-package diffs, and the test-evidence logs.
#
# It is tracked deliberately. The review diffs are derivable from git history,
# but the reports and logs are not: they are the evidence behind each task's
# verdict and each ruling's justification. Everything here is text; nothing
# here is environment.
#
# The research material is tracked too, at the repository owner's request: the
# user's own compendium (`GAME_REFERENCE.md`, renamed from its Chinese title on
# 2026-09-29) and the structure extract derived from it. See README.md for what
# that means for the project's claim about original text.

# Isolated worktrees for multi-phase work (superpowers:using-git-worktrees).
.worktrees/
